# The frontend has no runtime secrets. All API calls are same-origin (/api/...):
# - production: vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the Railway API (edit the destination URL there)
# - development: vite.config.ts proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Optional, development only: where `npm run dev` / `vite preview` proxy the API.
# VITE_DEV_API=http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# Anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled into public JavaScript, so never put secrets here.
